- a hardware interface (13), configured to activate functions and commands to operate the vehicle (1),
- badges (7), for each agent to be equipped with ;
- a badge reader (9), configured to be located in a driver's cab (2) of the vehicle (1) and to read the badges (7) ;
- a database (15) of registered agents (16), each registered agent (16) corresponding to one of the badges (7), and
